# Harbinger of the Tides at sorcery speed (CR 601.2b, 601.2f, 118.8). With four mana in hand ({U}{U} from a Mox Sapphire and an
# Island, two more from Moxen) the question "Flash: Pay {2} more" is asked, though nothing needs it (the rulings allow it): on
# turn 3 Bot1 pays it, all four mana sources tapped for the {2}{U}{U} (the Modes answer), and the Harbinger's mana value is
# still two (CR 202.3). On turn 5 the second Harbinger is cast for {U}{U} alone: the extra is declined and the two Moxen stay
# untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island
Harbinger of the Tides
Harbinger of the Tides
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

